@startuml
' System architecture (C4 level 2) — Google Cloud data + ML platform.
' Demonstrates the canonical Google Cloud icon usage: a Cloud Run service
' fronting GKE workloads, persisting to Cloud SQL + Cloud Storage, feeding
' BigQuery analytics and a Vertex AI model.
'
' Source: https://github.com/hanv89/archicon
' License: MIT (this diagram); see repo LICENSE.
' Icons:
'   Google Cloud product icons via the official Google Cloud Icon Library,
'   used for reference in architecture diagrams under Google''s brand /
'   trademark guidelines (reference use). Icons are rastered at a UNIFORM
'   square size (64x64) — proportional scaling only; no distortion, recolor,
'   or crop. Not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Google LLC.
'   See repo NOTICE § Google Cloud Icons + dist/GCP/USAGE-RULES.txt.
'
' Render: paste this file''s content into
'   https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/
' The PlantUML server fetches each <img:URL> at render time from this
' repository''s public raw URLs.

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

title Google Cloud data + ML platform

actor "User" as user

rectangle "**Cloud Run**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/GCP/png/CloudRun.png>\napi service (serverless)" as run

rectangle "**GKE**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/GCP/png/GKE.png>\nbatch + worker pods" as gke

rectangle "**Cloud SQL**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/GCP/png/CloudSQL.png>\ntransactional store" as sql

rectangle "**Cloud Storage**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/GCP/png/CloudStorage.png>\nraw object landing" as gcs

rectangle "**BigQuery**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/GCP/png/BigQuery.png>\nanalytics warehouse" as bq

rectangle "**Vertex AI**\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/GCP/png/VertexAI.png>\nmodel training + serving" as vertex

user -right-> run : HTTPS
run -right-> gke : enqueue jobs
run -down-> sql : read / write
gke -down-> gcs : write artifacts
gcs -right-> bq : load
bq -right-> vertex : training features
vertex -up-> run : predictions

@enduml
